<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-xian-of-han" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/emperor-xian-of-han.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/december-11">11 December</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Emperor Xian abdicates, ending the Han dynasty</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Emperor Xian, the last emperor of the Eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/han-dynasty">Han dynasty</a> and long a puppet of warlords, was forced to abdicate by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cao-pi">Cao Pi</a>, son of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cao-cao">Cao Cao</a>. Cao Pi founded the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cao-wei">Wei dynasty</a>, opening the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/three-kingdoms-period">Three Kingdoms period</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-xian-of-han">Emperor Xian of Han</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cao-pi">Cao Pi</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
